<title>USA: Transaction Network says forms new division.</title>
<headline>Transaction Network says forms new division.</headline>
<dateline>RESTON, Va. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transaction Network Services Inc said Wednesday it has formed a financial services division to support its new data network service.</p>
<p>The data network service, introduced earlier in the year, is designed to facilitate securities trading between buy and sell-side institutions.</p>
<p>John Schanz was named head of the new division. He was previously director of data engineering at Sprint Corp .</p>
